f-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years from 1951, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 34 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 60% of normal in August to September and 72% in July to August. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 179% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 27514 has a preliminary estimate of 76.5 for August to September 2026.</p>"}
